---
<Article
  image={{ src: "/img/gta-6/gta6-jason-rifle-slung-substation.webp", alt: "Jason pressed against a concrete wall with a rifle slung across his back" }}
  title="GTA 6 Unique Weapons: Locations & How to Get Them"
  h1="GTA 6 Unique Weapons and Where to Find Them"
  description="Where to find GTA 6's unique weapons: the Crabshack SMG, Permit Keys boat guns, every gang operation reward, and the launchers and snipers you can buy."
  published="2026-11-20"
  crumbs={[{ href: "/gta-6/", label: "GTA 6" }]}
  faq={faq}
  sources={[
    { href: "https://www.respec.net/guide/319-gta6-gang-operations-locations-list-robbery-opportunity-rewards", label: "respec.net: gang operation rewards" },
    { href: "https://www.noobfeed.com/articles/gta-6-early-game-guns", label: "NoobFeed: early game guns" },
    { href: "https://www.thebiglead.com/gta-6-pelican-valley-crab-research-outpost-computer-password-keypad-codes/", label: "The Big Lead: crab research outpost" },
    { href: "https://gamerhour.net/guides/gta-6-pelican-valley-outpost-puzzle-solution/", label: "GamerHour: Pelican Valley outpost" },
    { href: "https://meowdb.com/gta6/weapons", label: "meowdb: GTA 6 weapons" },
    { href: "https://games.gg/grand-theft-auto-vi/guides/gta-6-weapon-guide/", label: "games.gg: weapon guide" },
    { href: "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-how-to-get-grenade-launcher-rocket-launcher/", label: "PowerPyx: grenade and rocket launchers" },
    { href: "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-how-to-get-sniper-rifle/", label: "PowerPyx: sniper rifle" },
    { href: "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-how-to-get-ultimate-edition-rewards/", label: "PowerPyx: Ultimate Edition rewards" },
  ]}
>
  <p>GTA 6 hides about 130 unique weapon variants around Leonida: guns stashed on wrecks, rewards for clearing gang operations, and a few you can only buy. Here's where the ones found so far are.</p>

  <h2>How unique weapons work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Gold icon:</strong> unique weapons are marked in gold and <strong>can't be modified</strong>.</li>
    <li><strong>Shared:</strong> picking one up unlocks it for both Jason and Lucia.</li>
    <li><strong>Lost it?</strong> Get it back from the weapon locker at any Ammu-Nation.</li>
    <li><strong>Long guns</strong> are stored in your car's trunk.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hidden in the world</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Weapon</th><th>Where</th><th>Confirmed by</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{found.map(([w, l, s]) => <tr><td><strong>{w}</strong></td><td>{l}</td><td><small>{s}</small></td></tr>)}</tbody>
  </table></div>

  <h2>Gang operation rewards</h2>
  <p>Clearing a gang operation (a robbery opportunity at a hideout) rewards a unique weapon. These come from one detailed list. Clunker 556, Chromium W-10 and Kingfishers W-22 are confirmed by a second source.</p>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Weapon</th><th>Gang operation</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{gangOps.map(([w, l]) => <tr><td><strong>{w}</strong></td><td>{l}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p>Need a hideout safe code? Brooks Boatworks is 6823, La Cascara Motel 6969 and Kingpin Bowling 0300. See all <a href="/gta-6/safe-codes/">GTA 6 safe codes</a>.</p>

  <h2>Weapons you buy</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Weapon</th><th>Price</th><th>Requirement</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{bought.map(([w, p, r]) => <tr><td><strong>{w}</strong></td><td>{p}</td><td>{r}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p><small>Launcher prices come from a single completion guide.</small></p>

  <h2>Ultimate Edition weapons</h2>
  <p>The Ultimate Edition adds the <strong>Hawk &amp; Little Morgan</strong> revolvers and personalized pistols for each lead: a Girardi ES9 for Jason and a Klose K17 for Lucia. Guides disagree on the pistols' names ("Duval Signature ES9" and "Caminos Signature K17" in one). Claim the pistols from the Ammu-Nation weapon locker and buy the revolvers from the clerk. See <a href="/gta-6/editions/">Standard vs Ultimate</a>.</p>
</Article>
